---
permalink: "/_redirects"
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
# Netlify redirects — generated at build time from src/redirects.njk.
#
# The old Jekyll blog lived at blog.voyagebyluna.com. Its URLs are indexed by
# Google, linked from Pinterest and old posts, and subscribed to as a feed, so every
# one of them is redirected PERMANENTLY. Do not remove these rules.
#
# Netlify reads this file first, then the [[redirects]] in netlify.toml.
# The 26 old POST URLs live in netlify.toml, because they contain spaces and
# accented characters, which only match when written un-encoded (tested).
{% if launchGate.active %}
# ---- PRE-LAUNCH GATE ---------------------------------------------------------
# Generated only while src/_data/launch.json "mode" is not "live". Everything
# below this block is the normal site's rules and is untouched by the gate.
# Keep the CMS, its media, and crawler files reachable:
/admin/*  /admin/:splat  200!
/images/*  /images/:splat  200!
/robots.txt  /robots.txt  200!
/sitemap.xml  /sitemap.xml  200!
/google83dbb073897b0fa1.html  /google83dbb073897b0fa1.html  200!
# The homepage address shows the Coming Soon page:
/  /coming-soon/  200!
# Every other address temporarily (302) goes to the homepage. (Absolute on purpose:
# Netlify ignores "/* / 302!" as a possible loop — tested with the Netlify CLI.)
/*  https://voyagebyluna.com/  302!
# ---- END PRE-LAUNCH GATE -----------------------------------------------------
{%- endif %}
# ---- blog.voyagebyluna.com (active once that domain points at this Netlify site)
# Keep the Google Search Console verification file answering on the old host.
https://blog.voyagebyluna.com/google83dbb073897b0fa1.html  /google83dbb073897b0fa1.html  200!
https://blog.voyagebyluna.com/  https://voyagebyluna.com/blog/  301!

# ---- Old blog pages other than posts (work on either host)
{%- for r in legacyRedirects.paths %}
{{ r[0] }}  {{ r[1] if r[1].startsWith("http") else "https://voyagebyluna.com" + r[1] }}  301
{%- endfor %}
/categories/*  https://voyagebyluna.com/blog/  301
/tags/*  https://voyagebyluna.com/blog/  301
